source: crates/cosmon-cli/tests/help_goldens.rs
expression: stdout
---
List message stages and delivery state for messages you sent or receive

Usage: cs work list [OPTIONS] [OWNER]

Arguments:
  [OWNER]  Owner of the caller's declared work; defaults to that work

Options:
      --config <PATH>  Path to the state directory (default: the galaxy's .cosmon/state/)
      --pending        Only unexpired envelopes without a consumption report
      --open           Only envelopes without a consumption report
  -v, --verbose        Enable verbose output
      --json           Output in JSON format
  -h, --help           Print help
